## Task #27: `layout c` extended to class bodies.
##
## Same C-compatible-layout guarantee as struct-body `layout c`
## (ffi.spec.md §B8): fields in declaration order, native alignment,
## no reordering. Parser captures `"C"` on ClassDef.layout (note
## case-normalized — the surface accepts `c` or `C` per the existing
## struct convention).
##
## Codegen wiring (instances emitted as flat repr-C structs vs.
## opaque heap handles) lands in the follow-up; this fixture covers
## the parser+resolver surface only.

class CLayoutDemo
  layout c
  len: Int
  cap: Int
end
